    {
      "name": "places/ChIJZRhjMmvzaS4RrWuq19k_7Ik/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNtaGV1ZUx3EAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I visited this place to get a new haircut three days ago and I gotta say, Man…. I’m very satisfied with the result. The capster, Mas Harris (If I’m not mistaken) is quite knowledgeable about hair care treatment. The place is clean and well-decorated. The price is quite affordable. You can also get a glass of coffee while waiting for your turn if you want to. I haven’t tried the coffee tho, so I can’t give any feedback about that. You don’t bring cash? No worries because you can use your digital wallet or debit card. Overall, I enjoyed my visit. A nice place to hangout. A nice place to get a new haircut. Definitely will come back later",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "I visited this place to get a new haircut three days ago and I gotta say, Man…. I’m very satisfied with the result. The capster, Mas Harris (If I’m not mistaken) is quite knowledgeable about hair care treatment. The place is clean and well-decorated. The price is quite affordable. You can also get a glass of coffee while waiting for your turn if you want to. I haven’t tried the coffee tho, so I can’t give any feedback about that. You don’t bring cash? No worries because you can use your digital wallet or debit card. Overall, I enjoyed my visit. A nice place to hangout. A nice place to get a new haircut. Definitely will come back later",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
